Data used at run time (not redistributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C-SEO Bench (Puerto et al., NeurIPS 2025 Datasets and Benchmarks)
https://huggingface.co/datasets/cseo/cseo-bench
License: the dataset card's metadata says `license: cc` and names no specific
Creative Commons license (checked 2026-10-23, card revision
78c3a94143476b6252e5df63d5f16e2d8debf797). See the card for the current terms.

`ce pack cseo` (packages/bench/src/node/cseo.ts) downloads a question-answering
subset at run time into a gitignored local cache. No C-SEO Bench text is
committed to this repository or shipped in the workspace. The sample packs in
samples/ are synthetic, written for this project.
